{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux"]]},"kind":"article","primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"anchor":"Overview","text":"Overview","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Swidux ships a companion agent skill ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"swidux-ref"},{"type":"text","text":") for AI coding assistants like Claude Code. It contains the architecture rules, conventions, and code templates an assistant needs to generate correct Swidux code without you re-explaining the patterns."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The skill is published in "},{"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/heirloomlogic\/skills","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" — Heirloom Logic’s public skills repo — alongside any future Heirloom skills. Two files:"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SKILL.md"},{"text":" — architecture rules (the 10 rules, the dispatch lifecycle, plugin shapes, anti-patterns).","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"swidux-patterns.md","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" — copy-pasteable code templates for ","type":"text"},{"code":"AppState","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AppAction"},{"text":", reducers, ","type":"text"},{"code":"AppStore","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" factory, views, plugin wiring, and Swift Testing reducer tests."}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"anchor":"Installing-the-skill","text":"Installing the skill","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"anchor":"GitHub-CLI-recommended","text":"GitHub CLI (recommended)","level":3,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Requires "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"gh"},{"type":"text","text":" ≥ v2.90.0 ("},{"identifier":"https:\/\/cli.github.com","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":").","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"bash","type":"codeListing","code":["gh skill install heirloomlogic\/skills swidux-ref --agent claude-code --scope user"]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"--scope user"},{"type":"text","text":" installs to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"~\/.claude\/skills\/swidux-ref\/"},{"text":" (loads in every project).","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"--scope project","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" installs to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"<cwd>\/.claude\/skills\/swidux-ref\/"},{"type":"text","text":" (commit it so the whole team gets it)."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Pin a version with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"swidux-ref@v1.2.3"},{"type":"text","text":". List tags with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"git ls-remote --tags https:\/\/github.com\/heirloomlogic\/skills"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Other agents: pass "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"--agent codex"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"--agent cursor"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"--agent gemini-cli","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", etc. Run "},{"code":"gh skill install --help","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" for the full list."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"level":3,"text":"skills.sh","type":"heading","anchor":"skillssh"},{"type":"codeListing","code":["npx skillsadd heirloomlogic\/skills"],"syntax":"bash"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Indexes the same source repo. Works without a GitHub CLI install.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Manual-no-gh-no-npx","text":"Manual (no `gh`, no `npx`)","level":3,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Claude Code uses ","type":"text"},{"code":".claude\/skills\/","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". Codex, Cursor, Gemini CLI, and others use ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".